BT 0.08 0.16 0.27 rg /F2 15 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 503.89 Tm (1. Administrative model) Tj ET
0.12 0.39 0.65 RG 1.3 w 54 497.89 m 130 497.89 l S
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 477.89 Tm (Nexus HMS separates platform scope from tenant scope. A platform administrator has a null tenant) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 463.89 Tm (context and may manage platform-wide configuration. A tenant administrator operates inside one tenant) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 449.89 Tm (and may manage users, records, and security rules allowed by that tenant. Hotel roles should be) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 435.89 Tm (assigned according to least privilege.) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 414.89 Tm (The client interface may hide modules based on role, but the server guards are the final) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 400.89 Tm (authorization boundary. Never rely on a hidden navigation item to protect data.) Tj ET
BT 0.08 0.16 0.27 rg /F2 15 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 365.89 Tm (2. User lifecycle) Tj ET
0.12 0.39 0.65 RG 1.3 w 54 359.89 m 130 359.89 l S
BT 0.12 0.39 0.65 rg /F2 11.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 331.89 Tm (Provision) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 312.89 Tm (1. Confirm the user's employment, department, tenant, and required access.) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 291.89 Tm (2. Create the account with the minimum role needed.) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 270.89 Tm (3. Confirm the email and contact information through the approved onboarding process.) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 249.89 Tm (4. Give the user a first-login instruction through a secure channel.) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 228.89 Tm (5. Require MFA for administrators and any role that handles sensitive guest, financial, or) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 214.89 Tm (security information.) Tj ET
BT 0.12 0.39 0.65 rg /F2 11.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 185.89 Tm (Change) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 166.89 Tm (Review role, tenant, department, and active status when the user changes duties. Remove access that) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 152.89 Tm (is no longer needed before granting new access.) Tj ET
BT 0.12 0.39 0.65 rg /F2 11.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 123.89 Tm (Suspend and remove) Tj ET
