BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 775.89 Tm (5. The user enters a six-digit code.) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 754.89 Tm (6. A successful verification changes the MFA configuration to enabled.) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 733.89 Tm (Administrators should confirm that backup codes were stored safely without requesting that a user) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 719.89 Tm (send them to support.) Tj ET
BT 0.12 0.39 0.65 rg /F2 11.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 690.89 Tm (MFA recovery) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 671.89 Tm (An unused backup code can complete the MFA login step once. A consumed code cannot be reused. If all) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 657.89 Tm (codes are lost, follow the organization's identity-verification and administrator-assisted recovery) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 643.89 Tm (process. Do not manually edit encrypted MFA database values.) Tj ET
BT 0.12 0.39 0.65 rg /F2 11.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 614.89 Tm (Disablement) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 595.89 Tm (Disabling MFA requires the current TOTP code. This protects against a session being used to silently) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 581.89 Tm (remove a second factor. If a user cannot produce the code, use the approved recovery process rather) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 567.89 Tm (than bypassing the endpoint.) Tj ET
BT 0.08 0.16 0.27 rg /F2 15 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 532.89 Tm (5. Password policy) Tj ET
0.12 0.39 0.65 RG 1.3 w 54 526.89 m 130 526.89 l S
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 506.89 Tm (Password policy is platform-wide and can be modified only by a platform administrator. Supported) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 492.89 Tm (controls include:) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 471.89 Tm (- Minimum length, between 6 and 128 characters.) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 450.89 Tm (- Uppercase requirement.) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 429.89 Tm (- Number requirement.) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 408.89 Tm (- Symbol requirement.) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 387.89 Tm (- Expiry days, from no expiry through the configured maximum.) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 366.89 Tm (- Number of previous passwords to prevent reusing.) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 345.89 Tm (Choose policy values that match the organization's risk assessment. Avoid policy changes during a) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 331.89 Tm (login incident unless the change is part of the incident plan. A policy update should be recorded and) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 317.89 Tm (communicated to administrators.) Tj ET
BT 0.08 0.16 0.27 rg /F2 15 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 282.89 Tm (6. IP restrictions) Tj ET
0.12 0.39 0.65 RG 1.3 w 54 276.89 m 130 276.89 l S
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 256.89 Tm (IP rules support:) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 235.89 Tm (- Allowlist entries for an IPv4 address or IPv4 CIDR, such as `10.0.0.0/8`.) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 214.89 Tm (- Blocklist entries for an IPv4 address or IPv4 CIDR.) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 193.89 Tm (- A label to explain the business purpose.) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 172.89 Tm (- Global rules managed at platform scope.) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 151.89 Tm (- Tenant rules managed within tenant scope by an administrator.) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 130.89 Tm (Before adding an allowlist rule, confirm the administrator's current source IP and keep a tested) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 116.89 Tm (recovery route. Invalid formats, IPv6 values, and malformed CIDR prefixes are rejected. When a rule) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 102.89 Tm (changes, affected cached rules are invalidated.) Tj ET
