BT 0.28 0.33 0.39 rg /F2 7.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 807.89 Tm (NEXUS HMS USER MANAGEMENT AND SECURITY GUIDE) Tj ET
0.12 0.39 0.65 RG 1 w 54 798.89 m 541.28 798.89 l S
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 775.89 Tm (Use network firewalls or private ingress controls as the primary perimeter. Application IP rules are) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 761.89 Tm (a second layer and should not be the only protection for administrative access.) Tj ET
BT 0.08 0.16 0.27 rg /F2 15 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 726.89 Tm (7. Device management) Tj ET
0.12 0.39 0.65 RG 1.3 w 54 720.89 m 130 720.89 l S
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 700.89 Tm (The Active Devices view lists active mobile sessions for the current user. Each device should have a) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 686.89 Tm (recognizable name and platform. When a device is lost, replaced, or shared outside policy:) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 665.89 Tm (1. Revoke the device immediately.) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 644.89 Tm (2. Ask the user to change credentials if compromise is possible.) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 623.89 Tm (3. Check audit activity and recent login behavior.) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 602.89 Tm (4. Re-register only the verified replacement device.) Tj ET
BT 0.08 0.16 0.27 rg /F2 15 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 567.89 Tm (8. Tenant and organization administration) Tj ET
0.12 0.39 0.65 RG 1.3 w 54 561.89 m 130 561.89 l S
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 541.89 Tm (Create a tenant for a customer boundary and organizations or branches according to the operating) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 527.89 Tm (model. Validate tenant association before assigning users. Subscription and module configuration) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 513.89 Tm (should be reviewed before exposing features to an end user.) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 492.89 Tm (Important current boundary: legacy core hotel tables do not yet include complete tenant_id row) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 478.89 Tm (isolation. Tenant-aware BI and mobile services deliberately limit responses where a safe filter) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 464.89 Tm (cannot be applied. Do not enable unrestricted cross-tenant operational access until the core-table) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 450.89 Tm (migration is complete and verified.) Tj ET
BT 0.08 0.16 0.27 rg /F2 15 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 415.89 Tm (9. Audit and incident response) Tj ET
0.12 0.39 0.65 RG 1.3 w 54 409.89 m 130 409.89 l S
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 389.89 Tm (Review audit logs for:) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 368.89 Tm (- Repeated failed logins or MFA failures.) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 347.89 Tm (- Role, tenant, or user status changes.) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 326.89 Tm (- MFA enrollment or disablement.) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 305.89 Tm (- IP rule mutations.) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 284.89 Tm (- Device registration and revocation.) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 263.89 Tm (- Password-policy changes.) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 242.89 Tm (- Cache flushes and unusual administrative actions.) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 221.89 Tm (For suspected compromise:) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 200.89 Tm (1. Deactivate the affected user or revoke the device.) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 179.89 Tm (2. Preserve audit and application logs.) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 158.89 Tm (3. Check active sessions, IP rules, and recent changes.) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 137.89 Tm (4. Rotate affected secrets using the environment secret process.) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 116.89 Tm (5. Determine whether MFA secrets, refresh tokens, Redis credentials, or database data were) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 102.89 Tm (exposed.) Tj ET
0.78 0.81 0.84 RG 0.5 w 54 38 m 541.28 38 l S
