BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 775.89 Tm (6. Restore service only after verifying the new control state.) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 754.89 Tm (Do not include tokens, secrets, backup codes, or raw credentials in incident tickets.) Tj ET
