0.12 0.39 0.65 RG 1.3 w 54 713.89 m 130 713.89 l S
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 693.89 Tm (- [ ] Platform and tenant administrators are documented.) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 672.89 Tm (- [ ] Production `SESSION_SECRET`, `REDIS_PASSWORD`, and the credential-bearing `REDIS_URL`) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 658.89 Tm (  are held in the environment secret store.) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 637.89 Tm (- [ ] Redis password and URL credentials match, and readiness/smoke checks authenticate.) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 616.89 Tm (- [ ] Redis is private, reachable by every API replica, restricted to API-only ingress with) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 602.89 Tm (  denied egress, and used only for the Socket.IO backplane.) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 581.89 Tm (- [ ] Real production uses managed/private TLS Redis with `rediss://`, or an approved) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 567.89 Tm (  equivalent; the included internal Redis is not claimed to provide TLS.) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 546.89 Tm (- [ ] Administrator MFA is enabled and recovery ownership is known.) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 525.89 Tm (- [ ] Password policy has an approved owner and review date.) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 504.89 Tm (- [ ] Global and tenant IP rules have labels and recovery testing.) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 483.89 Tm (- [ ] Device revocation is part of offboarding.) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 462.89 Tm (- [ ] Metrics access is restricted at the network boundary.) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 441.89 Tm (- [ ] CORS origins are restricted in production.) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 420.89 Tm (- [ ] Backups are encrypted and restoration is tested.) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 399.89 Tm (- [ ] Audit logs are retained according to policy.) Tj ET
BT 0.15 0.17 0.2 rg /F1 9.4 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 378.89 Tm (- [ ] Core-table tenant isolation limitations are acknowledged.) Tj ET
